  "description": "Optional add-on for League of Legends Heroes: Viego's Sovereign's Domination as in League. When an enemy champion he damaged dies, its soul waits by the body; near it he possesses it - on game 0.6.3 his whole body becomes that champion - and fights with its class's moves (fighter, marksman, mage, support or assassin). The data pack sees deaths only roughly and keeps Viego's own look; this add-on reads every takedown and draws the possessed body. Harrowed Path's mist rises by itself when an enemy champion comes near (an internal cooldown: move and attack speed, a short camouflage), and W is Spectral Maw alone. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
  "last_updated": "2026-10-30",
  "mod_id": "league_viego_soul",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "name": "League Heroes: Viego's possession",
  "version": "0.2.32"
}
